{"id":"testimonialscroll","code":"<style>.tsc{width:340px;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;padding:14px 0}\n.tsc .row{display:flex;gap:12px;overflow-x:auto;padding:4px 16px 12px;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;-webkit-mask:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#000 8%,#000 92%,transparent);mask:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#000 8%,#000 92%,transparent)}\n.tsc .row::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}.tsc .row{scrollbar-width:none}\n.tsc .c{flex:0 0 210px;scroll-snap-align:center;border:1px solid var(--line,#262C34);background:var(--card,#171B22);border-radius:16px;padding:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}\n.tsc .c p{margin:0;color:var(--body,#B6BDC8);font:450 12px Inter,sans-serif;line-height:1.5}\n.tsc .c p mark{background:rgba(51,102,255,.14);color:var(--accent,#3366FF);padding:0 3px;border-radius:3px}\n.tsc .st{color:var(--accent,#3366FF);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;margin:12px 0 6px}\n.tsc .c b{color:var(--ink,#fff);font:600 12px Inter,sans-serif}.tsc .c span{display:block;color:var(--body,#B6BDC8);font:400 10px Inter,sans-serif}</style>\n<div class=\"tsc\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"c\"><p>The AI analytics revolutionised our cycle. <mark>More accurate and faster than ever.</mark></p><div class=\"st\">★★★★★</div><b>Alex Rivera</b><span>CTO at InnovateTech</span></div><div class=\"c\"><p>Their prediction model improved targeting. <mark>A 50% lift in conversions!</mark></p><div class=\"st\">★★★★★</div><b>Samantha Lee</b><span>Marketing Director</span></div><div class=\"c\"><p>We move fast and stay ahead. <mark>Our dev speed has doubled.</mark></p><div class=\"st\">★★★★★</div><b>Raj Patel</b><span>Founder & CEO</span></div></div></div>"}